{#-
  data-form="pledge" — double opt-in. Disabled unless features.formsOpen; see
  partials/forms/updates.njk for why nothing renders while it is off.

  When open (records/changes/CHG-009) it posts to the same-origin handler
  /api/signup/pledge (website/functions/api/signup/pledge.js), which forwards
  to the uncost-signups Worker (uncost-org/uncost-api). That sends a 24-hour
  confirmation link; the signature counts only once it is confirmed. With JS
  on, ui.js sends it with fetch and writes the result into .err; with JS off,
  the browser posts it and lands on /pledge/check-email/ (or
  /signup/not-sent/). Native validation (no novalidate) marks and announces a
  missing or malformed email and an unticked agree or age box in both modes,
  and the server checks them again. The box texts come from _data/signups.json,
  which the handler hashes into each consent event, so they cannot drift. The
  updates box is optional and unticked; the same confirmation link confirms
  it. hp_url is a honeypot, hidden from people and from assistive technology.
-#}
{% if features.formsOpen %}
<form id="pledge-form" class="pl-form" data-form="pledge" data-live action="/api/signup/pledge" method="post">
  <div class="u-84">
    <div><label class="skip-link" for="pl-name">Name (optional)</label><input id="pl-name" class="field" type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="80" placeholder="Name (optional)"></div>
    <div><label class="skip-link" for="pl-email">Email (required)</label><input id="pl-email" class="field" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" placeholder="Email" required></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hp" hidden><label for="pl-hp">Leave this field empty</label><input id="pl-hp" type="text" name="hp_url" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div>
  <div class="consents">
    <label class="crow"><input type="checkbox" name="agree" value="yes" required><span>{{ signups.texts.signing }} <span class="req">(required)</span></span></label>
    <label class="crow"><input type="checkbox" name="updates" value="yes"><span>{{ signups.texts.email_updates_pledge }}</span></label>
    <label class="crow agerow"><input type="checkbox" name="age" value="yes" required><span>{{ signups.texts.age | replace("{minAge}", signups.minAge) }} <span class="req">(required)</span></span></label>
  </div>
  <button class="pbtn" type="submit">Add my name</button>
  <div class="err" role="alert" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <div class="privacy"><span>We won&rsquo;t sell your data or use your pledge for partisan targeting. A confirmation link &mdash; valid for 24 hours &mdash; must be clicked before your signature counts. If you don&rsquo;t confirm, we delete your sign-up after 7 days. <a href="/privacy/#s11">Privacy policy</a></span></div>
</form>
{% else %}
<div class="form-off" data-pledge-form data-form="pledge">
  <div class="form-off-msg">Sign-ups open soon.</div>
  <div class="form-off-sub">The pledge opens soon. Nothing to enter yet.</div>
</div>
{% endif %}
